### Day 9 - JWT Authentication Tests
### Run the app first:
### Base URL: 

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080

### 1. Health Check - public endpoint
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/health

#### 2. Try to access assets without token - should return 401 Unauthorized
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/assets

### 3. Register a regular user - should return token with role USER
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json
{
  "name": "Normal User",
  "email": "user@example.com",
  "password": "User@12345"
}

### 4. Login as regular user - should return token with role USER
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json
{
  "email": "user@example.com",
  "password": "User@12345"
}

### 5. Get assets with user token - should return 200 OK
@userToken = REPLACE_WITH_USER_TOKEN
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/assets
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}